# CR — *Chlamydomonas reinhardtii* bundle

## Status

**Assembled** — TIER1/TIER2/TIER3 populated; pending validation against CR
LC-MS/MS data.

## Species information

| Item | Value |
|------|-------|
| Organism | *Chlamydomonas reinhardtii* |
| Clade | Chlorophyte (green alga) |
| Relevance | Model for algal chromatin biology |

## Known sequence differences vs. AT / human

Key substitution identified from preliminary MSA:

- H3 27-40: **KTPATGGVKKPHR** (shorter motif; differs from human
  KSAPATGGVKKPHR and AT variants)
- Additional variants pending full MSA characterisation

## Subdirectories

- `PV/` — Preliminary validation data and notes (currently empty).

## Bundle contents

| Directory | Files | Description |
|-----------|-------|-------------|
| `src/TIER1/` | 72 | Upstream EpiProfile 2.0 basic (unchanged) |
| `src/TIER2/` | 10 | Modified: init_histone0 + DrawISOProfile1 + robustness |
| `src/TIER3/` | 9 | AT-derived + CR-specific (H3_14_27_40 with KTPATGGVKKPHR) |
| `PV/` | 0 | Preliminary validation (awaiting test data) |

## Running

```matlab
cd bundles/CR/src
EpiProfile
```

See `docs/tiers.md` for tier definitions.
